# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GTA6Store — Environment Variables
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Add ALL of these in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables

# ── Site URL ────────────────────────────────────────────────
SITE_URL=https://gta6store.co.uk

# ── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-ID.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...        # paste into HTML files too
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=eyJ...     # server only — never in HTML

# ── CryptAPI — Your Wallet Addresses ────────────────────────
# No account needed. No KYC. Just paste your own wallet addresses.
# CryptAPI creates a unique forwarding address per payment.
# They take 1% fee. Remaining goes straight to your wallet.
#
# Get wallet addresses:
#   BTC  → download BlueWallet (iOS/Android) → copy Bitcoin address
#   ETH  → MetaMask → copy Ethereum address
#   USDT → any TRC-20 wallet (TronLink, Trust Wallet) → USDT TRC-20 address
#   USDC → MetaMask or Coinbase Wallet → copy Ethereum address (ERC-20)
#   SOL  → Phantom Wallet → copy Solana address
#
CRYPTAPI_BTC_ADDRESS=bc1q...your_bitcoin_address_here
CRYPTAPI_ETH_ADDRESS=0x...your_ethereum_address_here
CRYPTAPI_USDT_ADDRESS=T...your_usdt_trc20_address_here
CRYPTAPI_USDC_ADDRESS=0x...your_usdc_erc20_address_here
CRYPTAPI_SOL_ADDRESS=...your_solana_address_here

# ── Brevo (Email) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional — site works without this, emails just won't send.
# brevo.com → free account → SMTP & API → Create API Key
# Also verify sender domain: bookings@gta6store.co.uk
BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-YOUR_KEY_HERE

# ── Admin (for sending launch reminder emails) ───────────────
ADMIN_SECRET=pick_any_random_string

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUICK SETUP GUIDE:
#
# 1. SUPABASE (5 min):
#    → supabase.com → New Project → SQL Editor → run supabase-setup.sql
#    → Settings → API → copy URL + anon key + service_role key
#    → paste URL and anon key into: index.html, news.html, article.html, admin.html
#
# 2. CRYPTAPI WALLETS (2 min):
#    → No signup needed at cryptapi.io
#    → Just copy your wallet addresses into the env vars above
#    → Test by making a real tiny payment (e.g. $0.01 worth of BTC)
#
# 3. VERCEL DEPLOY (5 min):
#    → Push to GitHub
#    → vercel.com/new → import repo
#    → Settings → Environment Variables → add all above
#    → Redeploy
#
# 4. DOMAIN DNS (gta6store.co.uk → Vercel):
#    A     @    76.76.21.21
#    CNAME www  cname.vercel-dns.com
#
# 5. BREVO EMAIL (optional, set up later):
#    → brevo.com → free account (300 emails/day)
#    → SMTP & API → API Keys → Create
#    → Senders → Add bookings@gta6store.co.uk → verify domain
#
# CryptAPI Docs: https://cryptapi.io/api/
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
